<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/36/eng@/~cl_9__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "A member of a Rukun Tetangga Area Committee who is a permanent resident appointed immediately before the date of coming into operation of this Act shall, on the date of coming into operation of this Act, continue to be a member of the Rukun Tetangga Area Committee until his appointment is revoked or expires."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/36/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/36/eng@/~cl_9__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/36/eng@/~cl_9> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/36/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/36/eng@/~cl_9__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/36/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/36/eng@/~cl_9__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/36/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/36/eng@/~cl_9__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "A member of a Voluntary Patrolling Scheme who is not a citizen and whose membership has been approved immediately before the date of coming into operation of this Act shall, on the date of coming into operation of this Act, continue to be a member of the Voluntary Patrolling Scheme until his membership is terminated."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/36/eng@> .
